              c: "Rhodiola rosea was used by Persian and Central Asian healers working at high altitudes to support endurance, mental clarity, and resistance to environmental stress."),
        Quote(q: "Smell the rose to heal the heart. Taste the honey to heal the stomach. Listen to poetry to heal the soul.",
