              c: "Persian medicine recognized the healing power of beauty — fragrance, taste, music, and verse were all considered therapeutic modalities as legitimate as herbal decoctions."),
        Quote(q: "The learned physician knows the time to give medicine. The wise physician knows the time to give silence.",
