              c: "Intention — niyyat — was considered in Persian Sufi medicine to be an activating force in healing. A remedy given without belief and desire was thought to lose much of its power."),
        Quote(q: "The healer who does not heal himself cannot long heal another.",
              a: "Ibn Sina",
              c: "Ibn Sina, who himself struggled with illness throughout his prolific career, wrote extensively on the physician's self-care as a prerequisite for sustained and effective practice.")
    ]

