        Quote(q: "Cacao was the first medicine of the Americas. It opens the heart and feeds the will.",
              a: "Aztec tradition",
              c: "Theobroma cacao — 'food of the gods' — was used ceremonially and medicinally by the Aztec and Maya for centuries, believed to strengthen the heart, invigorate the body, and expand consciousness.")
