              c: "Rosmarinus officinalis has been used in European herbalism for circulation, memory, digestion, and antimicrobial purposes since at least the time of Dioscorides (~40–90 CE)."),
        Quote(q: "Simples are the foundation of the art. Master the single herb before you blend.",
